<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSSx9" title="In Appendix B Appendix C: Experiments and Evaluations ‣ Binary Quantization For LLMs Through Dynamic Grouping" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Comparison for window (initial group) size against quantization loss and speed.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
